usage: corpus-nav.py find [-h] [--in {blocks,docs,retros,all}] [--limit LIMIT]
                          [--and | --or]
                          query

positional arguments:
  query

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --in {blocks,docs,retros,all}
                        corpus subset to search (default: blocks)
  --limit, -n LIMIT     max matching lines to print (default: 50)
  --and                 ALL terms must appear in a block (AND mode)
  --or                  ANY term matches (OR mode, default)
